01:17:20.280 --> 01:17:22.660
- God is in the flame.

01:17:22.660 --> 01:17:24.430
What does it mean?

01:17:24.430 --> 01:17:26.450
- I don't know, it's a little esoteric for me

01:17:26.450 --> 01:17:28.070
that there's a dress on the back.

01:17:31.280 --> 01:17:32.660
I'm getting stoned already.

01:17:32.660 --> 01:17:38.070
The reality is a deadly war.

01:18:02.010 --> 01:18:04.650
Dave, where'd she go?

01:18:05.950 --> 01:18:08.540
She's far away.

01:18:09.810 --> 01:18:12.970
Come on, tell me.

01:18:13.450 --> 01:18:16.320
She's on a trip, a long trip.

01:18:17.690 --> 01:18:20.220
What are you saying?

01:18:21.380 --> 01:18:25.630
She's gone to the end of the universe, on STP.

01:18:26.050 --> 01:18:27.650
And she's out in the street alone?

01:18:27.970 --> 01:18:29.890
She's gone to Seek the Seeker.

01:18:30.160 --> 01:18:31.740
She hides and you see her.

01:18:31.740 --> 01:18:33.880
You sick, crazy bastard!

01:18:33.880 --> 01:18:36.620
Do you understand that she does not know that drug

01:18:36.620 --> 01:18:38.000
and that something could happen to her?

01:18:38.000 --> 01:18:39.450
She could be hurt!

01:18:39.450 --> 01:18:40.340
Come on!

01:19:15.100 --> 01:19:17.030
He said fire the house and he won't come out.

01:19:17.030 --> 01:19:17.930
- Did he do that?

01:19:17.930 --> 01:19:19.570
- I don't know, why did some of them jump out wounded?

01:19:19.570 --> 01:19:21.440
- Hey, hey, stop!

01:24:30.510 --> 01:24:36.790
It's a deadly place. I hope this trip is a good one.
